SUMMARY:Global Music Nights: Emad & Gandhaar
DESCRIPTION:Let’s go global! Union Summer’s Global Music Nights\, in collaboration with Small World Music\, bring the world to the waterfront with a vibrant roster of local\, national\, and international artists. \nFor more than two decades\, Small World Music has championed cultural diversity across the GTA—and now that spirit comes alive on our stage. Experience an unforgettable mix of sounds\, rhythms\, and traditions as the patio transforms into a celebration of global talent\, connection\, and discovery. \nEmad Saedi is an Iranian pianist\, composer\, producer\, and DJ based in Toronto. His work blends classical training with cinematic storytelling and electronic production\, creating immersive\, genre-defying soundscapes. Known for uplifting compositions and refined sound design\, he delivers performances that feel both emotional and transportive. \nStay tuned for additional artist details for this slot. \nThis program is in partnership with Small World Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/global-music-nights-emad-gandhaar/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
