SUMMARY:TGIT: Chai and Jam
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live bands. \nUnion Summer’s TGIT series transforms the patio into a vibrant evening destination\, kicking off the weekend early with live performances\, great energy\, and a lively crowd. Come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nChai and Jam takes the stage for an evening performance as part of the TGIT series at Union Summer\, delivering a live set designed for an upbeat and engaging patio experience.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/tgit-chai-and-jam/
