SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: DJ Shady Fransis
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nWith 10 years of experience\, DJ Shady Fransis has mastered a range of international musical styles\, from 1950s classics to current hits. Let yourself be taken on a musical journey through the decades under the direction of this professional DJ who knows how to rock the dance floor.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-wiwa/
