SUMMARY:Sunflower Garden Fest presents : Luciana B2B Shera
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. \nJoin Sunflower Garden Festival for a series of vibrant daytime musical experiences designed to uplift\, inspire\, and bring people together. Each performance blends live musicians\, vocalists\, and DJ sets curated for unique and memorable combinations\, taking audiences on a journey through soulful grooves\, feel-good rhythms\, live improvisation\, and uplifting dance music. \nSunflower Garden Festival is a music and wellness festival that encourages connection\, self-expression\, and celebration through music\, movement\, and community. \nRooted in the values of Sunflower Garden Festival\, these performances invite you to move freely and experience the power of music as a catalyst for community\, self-expression\, and collective wellbeing. \nAn all-female collective vibe bringing soulful\, funky house music to the stage. With live vocals by Luciana and live sax with Citizen Honey\, this collaborative funky set will bring live energy to the DJ set. \nThis program is in partnership with Sunflower Garden Festival
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/saturday-vibes-union-summer-3/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
