SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Juan de Sedas
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August programming features performers from TD-supported festivals\, highlighting a wide range of musical voices and global influences. \nJuan de Sedas delivers a performance rooted in Latin musical traditions\, bringing rhythm-driven energy and contemporary influences to the Union Summer stage. \nIn partnership with Pan Am Food Fest\, this set celebrates cultural connection through music and community.
