SUMMARY:Tuesday Tastemaker Series: ZEUS
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. In partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, Departure Festival\, and Mirvish Productions\, the patio transforms into a vibrant showcase designed for discovery and connection where tastemakers gather to mix\, mingle\, and experience incredible live music. \nZEUS delivers a live performance as part of this curated tastemaker experience\, presented in partnership with Polaris Music Prize. The set highlights contemporary artistry within an intimate midweek showcase designed for discovery and connection.
