SUMMARY:Global Music Nights: The Toronto Klezmer Society
DESCRIPTION:Let’s go global! Union Summer’s Global Music Nights\, in collaboration with Small World Music\, bring the world to the waterfront with a vibrant roster of local\, national\, and international artists. \nFor more than two decades\, Small World Music has championed cultural diversity across the GTA—and now that spirit comes alive on our stage. Experience an unforgettable mix of sounds\, rhythms\, and traditions as the patio transforms into a celebration of global talent\, connection\, and discovery. \nThe Toronto Klezmer Society was founded in 2018 with the goal of growing and celebrating Klezmer and Jewish music in Toronto and beyond. Dedicated to preserving the rich traditions of the genre while exploring new creative directions\, the collective brings together musicians\, audiences\, and communities through performance\, education\, and cultural exchange. \nTheir performances showcase the vibrant sounds and history of Klezmer music while introducing the genre to new audiences through engaging and dynamic live experiences. \nThis program is in partnership with Small World Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/global-music-nights-the-toronto-klezmer-society/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
