SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: DJ Fizza
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nDJ Fizza is an award-winning Toronto-based DJ with over 12 years of professional experience and a reputation as one of Canada’s most in-demand female DJs. Known for her versatility and polished performance style\, she has played high-profile events including NBA All-Star Weekend\, Toronto Fashion Week\, TIFF\, Pride Toronto\, and major corporate activations across North America. \nHer career spans elite entertainment\, fashion\, sports\, and corporate events\, where she consistently delivers high-energy sets tailored to diverse audiences. DJ Fizza continues to be recognized for her skill\, professionalism\, and influence in the Canadian DJ scene.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-fizza/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
