SUMMARY:TGIT: Marta Elena
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live bands. \nUnion Summer’s TGIT series transforms the patio into a vibrant evening destination\, kicking off the weekend early with live performances\, great energy\, and a lively crowd. Come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nMarta Elena is a JUNO Award–winning Cuban-Canadian artist born into a musical family in Havana. Her work reflects a deep connection to Afro-Latin musical roots while embracing contemporary approaches to Latin music expression. Known for her dynamic presence and cultural authenticity\, she brings a rich\, rhythm-driven performance style to the stage. \nThis program is in partnership with Lula Lounge.
