SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: The Recipee
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. \nFrom smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nreturning to Union – Jason Larmond\, Juwayon Clarke (pronounced “Zhu-way-on”)\, Johnathan Kerr\, and Omar Lunan make up The Recipee\, bringing with them more than 20 years of experience in performing\, writing\, arranging\, and producing music. Known for their high-energy performances and extensive repertoire\, The Recipee Band is a crowd favourite. Their combined credits include Justin Bieber\, Brandy\, Deborah Cox\, Mýa\, Tank\, Kim Burrell\, Usher\, Kardinal Offishall\, Shawn Desman\, Glenn Lewis\, and JRDN\, among others. The Recipee stays committed to staying up-to-date with various genres\, including gospel\, rock\, soul\, funk\, country\, jazz\, reggae\, and blues\, ensuring they can find the right mix to please any audience.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-the-recipee/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
