SUMMARY:Saturday Vibes: 2 Mile Hill
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. \nEase into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nArtist lineup will be announced soon—stay tuned. \nThis program is in partnership with Barbados Tourism.
