SUMMARY:Day Parties: Starting From Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nStarting From Scratch is widely regarded as one of Canada’s most influential DJs and a defining figure in the country’s music culture. With a career spanning major national radio stations including Virgin 99.9 FM and Flow 93.5 FM\, he has played a key role in shaping the sound of Canadian urban music and DJ culture. \nKnown for his technical skill\, musical range\, and long-standing presence on international stages\, Starting From Scratch has toured with major artists and built a reputation as a foundational figure in Canada’s DJ community. His sets reflect decades of experience\, blending genres and eras into a seamless\, high-energy performance.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/day-parties-starting-from-scratch/
