SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Big Smoke Brass
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nBig Smoke Brass returns to Union Summer as one of Canada’s leading voices in the brass music scene. Known for their high-energy performances and vibrant repertoire\, the group delivers an upbeat\, celebratory live experience designed to get the crowd moving while keeping the spirit of live brass at the center.
