SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: DJ Sathish
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August programming features performers from TD-supported festivals\, showcasing a wide range of sounds and cultural influences. \nThis special TD Music Tuesdays edition features a two-part program with DJ Sathish followed by a live performance from Maple Masala\, delivering an energetic blend of contemporary and traditional influences. \nIn partnership with Desifest\, this performance highlights South Asian music and celebration through rhythm\, dance\, and community connection.
